Package: noisitron
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libgtk-3-0, libnss3, libxss1, libxtst6, libnotify4, libatspi2.0-0, libsecret-1-0, xdg-utils, libpulse0
Recommends: libappindicator3-1
Description: Soundboard that mixes clips into a virtual mic for Discord
 Noisitron mixes local audio clips into a virtual PulseAudio/PipeWire
 microphone so Discord (or any other app) hears them alongside your
 voice, while you monitor playback through your headphones.
 .
 This package repackages the project's prebuilt Linux release (an
 Electron app) rather than compiling from source - see debian/README.source.
